      "description": "Faculty & Staff Holidays | Lenoir-Rhyne University Jump to Header Jump to Main Content Jump to Footer Return to home Open Menu Open Search Search Search Close Search Admission & Aid Click to toggle child links Undergraduate Admission Graduate Admission Seminary Admission Financial Aid & Costs LR Tuition-Free Guarantee College Affordability Paying Your Bill Academics Click to toggle child links Undergraduate Programs Graduate & Doctoral Programs Seminary Programs BEAR Central & Academic Support Research & Scholarship Study Abroad & International Education Internships & Careers Centers & Institutes Registrar Library Student Experience Click to toggle child links Activities & Organizations Athletics Health & Wellness Residence Life Leadership & Service Religious & Spiritual Life Campus Safety Dean of Students Belonging at LR Student Support & Outreach LR Experience Athletics About Click to toggle child links Fast Facts History & Traditions University Leadership Strategic Plan Accreditation Directory Offices & Services Community Partners Resources for Alumni Students Faculty & Staff Parents & Families Apply Visit Request Info Give Close Menu Home Page Work at LR Faculty & Staff Holidays Faculty & Staff Holidays Lenoir-Rhyne recognizes the importance of a healthy employee work-life balance and offers ample paid vacation and holidays. 2026-2027 Holidays 2026 Holidays New Year’s Holiday (Observed): Thursday-Friday, January 1-2 Martin Luther King Jr. Day: Monday, January 19 Easter Holiday: Friday and Monday, April 3 and April 6 Memorial Day: Monday, May 25 Juneteenth: Friday, June 19 Independence Day (Observed): Friday, July 3 Labor Day: Monday, September 7 Thanksgiving Holiday: Wednesday-Friday, November 25-27 Winter Break: Monday–Friday, December 21-25 Monday–Thursday, December 28-31 2027 Holidays New Year’s Day: Friday, January 1 Martin Luther King Jr. Day: Monday, January 18 Easter Holiday: Friday and Monday, March 26 and March 29 Memorial Day: Monday, May 31 Juneteenth (Observed): Friday, June 18 Independence Day (Observed): Monday, July 5 Labor Day: Monday, September 6 Thanksgiving Holiday: Wednesday-Friday, November 24-26 Winter Break: Monday-Friday, December 20-24 Monday-Friday, December 27-31 Work at LR Benefits Summary TimelyCare Virtual Health & Wellbeing Faculty & Staff Holidays Human Resources Get Info Visit Apply Deposit Return to home Find us on Facebook Subscribe on YouTube Follow us on Instagram 625 7th Ave NE, Hickory, NC 28601 828.328.1741 Directory Virtual Tour, Maps & Directions Events Calendar University News Profile Magazine Work at LR Library Bookstore Copyright Privacy Policy Accessibility Title IX Safety & Emergency Preparedness Consumer Information Coronavirus © 2026 Lenoir-Rhyne University Use of personal data and cookies This website uses cookies to improve your experience. Data Privacy Statement OK May I help you? × Hi there! Do you have any questions?"
